From 9bcb629c62b91fc5675ddb58665b1f410aafea4c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 05:21:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Split quota cost across official and banked weekly resets

Previous This week / Last week rows assumed a regular 7-day grid from
the live next reset. Observed Weekly resetsAt samples and redeemed
reset-credit times now become extra window boundaries, so an official
rollover and a later banked reset on the same day get separate cost
totals. Short windows are labeled Previous window instead of Last week.

Co-authored-by: stabeyzhou <stabeyzhou@gmail.com>
